{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":17154,\"date\":\"2026-08-25T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-25T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilascia-beta-7-macos-golden-gate-siri-ai-nuove-funzioni-ui\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la beta 7 di macOS Golden Gate: Siri AI, nuove funzioni e ritocchi UI\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple mette a disposizione degli sviluppatori la settima beta di macOS Golden Gate. Tra le novità: Siri AI in stile chatbot, miglioramenti di interfaccia e strumenti AI in Foto, Safari, Password e Image Playground.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macOS-27-next-to-MacBook-Pro-Running-macOS-27\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17162,\"date\":\"2026-08-24T22:35:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-24T20:35:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-seconda-release-candidate-macos-tahoe-26-7-sequoia-15-8\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le seconde Release Candidate di macOS Tahoe 26.7 e macOS Sequoia 15.8\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple distribuisce agli sviluppatori le seconde Release Candidate di macOS Tahoe 26.7 e macOS Sequoia 15.8, a una settimana dalle prime. In parallelo arriva anche la beta 7 di macOS 27 Golden Gate.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/macos-tahoe-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"macos-tahoe\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17059,\"date\":\"2026-08-21T09:28:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-21T07:28:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-26-7-roadmap-apple-iphone-ultra-airpods-fotocamere-robot-da-tavolo-nuovi-mac\",\"titl